 "Hiharu Hara is a big sister otokonoko (男の娘). He is an ex-wife to a yakuza. His parents are very rich, and forced him to marry a yakuza for political and financial reasons. He agreed because he was always disappointing his parents when he did not grow up as a proper man. The yakuza husband found out he was a man and they started to fight. Hiharu tried to kill his yakuza husband and is now on the run from the yakuza organization and his family. \n\nHe is in hiding, sneaky, but also sexy and cool. Smokes, and wears skimpy clothes, and is silly and funny. The yakuza is after him but he still lives very carefree and unbothered.\n\nCan you draw Hiharu squatting like a gangster, holding a bat over his shoulder? Please have a lit cigarette hanging out his mouth. Showing a little underwear is good. The contrast between a beautiful feminine looking man and how he squats like a thug and acts unrestrained will be very good and funny. \n\nI have a feeling you draw good yankee characters *laughs*\n\nThank you so much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1clfaHEGG-zXfLmURAdvxeGIwytfe7fhn?usp=sharing", "nc": 153, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ssmt_ohirune/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2044299, "client_id": 2080195, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/0969c2cc/uploads/origins/6f0062aa-85fb-43b0-aa6a-db0044bfedb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39f52eebacba7d1a0d003da578929336", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0969c2cc/uploads/origins/6f0062aa-85fb-43b0-aa6a-db0044bfedb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39f52eebacba7d1a0d003da578929336, https://si.imgix.net/0969c2cc/uploads/origins/6f0062aa-85fb-43b0-aa6a-db0044bfedb1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=451c88a23b0838a1d5d61d26